---
/** The film: real footage of squad-kit taking a ticket from ask to release. */
---

<section id="film" class="film" aria-labelledby="film-title">
  <div class="container-page">
    <h2 id="film-title">Watch a ticket go from ask to release</h2>
    <p>Real footage, no music: a plain-words ticket, the squad at work, an Arabic talk, the proof, and the release.</p>
    <video class="player" controls preload="metadata" playsinline poster="/film/poster.jpg" width="1920" height="1080">
      <source src="/film/squad-kit-1.0.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
      Your browser cannot play this video. <a href="/film/squad-kit-1.0.mp4">Download the film</a>.
    </video>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .film { padding: clamp(72px, 9vw, 120px) 0; background: var(--color-night); color: var(--color-night-text); }
  h2 { font-size: clamp(34px, 4.6vw, 58px); line-height: 1.02; font-weight: 650; font-stretch: 86%; letter-spacing: -0.03em; text-wrap: balance; max-width: 18ch; }
  p { margin-top: 16px; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--color-night-muted); max-width: 60ch; }
  .player { margin-top: 40px; display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 16px; border: 1px solid var(--color-night-line); background: #000; }
  a { color: #7cd99b; }
</style>
